§ `s 3 -- tax-free threshold`

#ASSERT `the tax-free threshold` EQUALS 18200

§ `Schedule 7 Part I -- which years have a table`

#ASSERT NOT `the deposit has a resident table for the year` 2023
#ASSERT `the deposit has a resident table for the year` 2024
#ASSERT `the deposit has a resident table for the year` 2025
#ASSERT `the deposit has a resident table for the year` 2026
#ASSERT `the deposit has a resident table for the year` 2033

§ `Schedule 7 Part I -- the three resident tables`

#ASSERT `the resident tax on ordinary taxable income` 2024 18200 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `the resident tax on ordinary taxable income` 2024 45000 EQUALS JUST 4288
#ASSERT `the resident tax on ordinary taxable income` 2024 135000 EQUALS JUST 31288
#ASSERT `the resident tax on ordinary taxable income` 2024 190000 EQUALS JUST 51638
#ASSERT `the resident tax on ordinary taxable income` 2024 250000 EQUALS JUST 78638
#ASSERT `the resident tax on ordinary taxable income` 2026 71500 EQUALS JUST 11970
#ASSERT `the resident tax on ordinary taxable income` 2027 71500 EQUALS JUST 11702
#ASSERT `the resident tax on ordinary taxable income` 2023 27500 EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 3 -- prescribed non-resident`

#ASSERT `a prescribed non-resident` `a non-resident earning $30,000`
#ASSERT NOT `a prescribed non-resident` `a non-resident all year paid a Social Security pension`
#ASSERT NOT `a prescribed non-resident` `an arrival in October 2024, pro-rated threshold $13,650 (assumed input)`

§ `s 18 -- part-year residency period`

#ASSERT `there is a part-year residency period` `an arrival in October 2024, pro-rated threshold $13,650 (assumed input)`
#ASSERT NOT `there is a part-year residency period` `an arrival who is an eligible pensioner`
#ASSERT NOT `there is a part-year residency period` `Chloe, 2024-25 return (c048)`

